001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.    SPOBYVEN.
001300 AUTHOR.        CA KRIST/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.  FEBRUARY 10, 1984.
001500*INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
001600*REMARKS.
      *****************************************************************
      *D        -----  Q 5  -----
      *D   PO INQURIY BY VENDOR CODE FRONT-END SCREEN SUBPROGRAM
      *****************************************************************

      *****************************************************************
      **          M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *C                  ***  PROGRAM CHANGES   ***
      *C   ON MAY 1, 1985; ADDED BLOWUP ROUTINE. DELETED SUBROUTINE
      *C                   PARAMETERS THAT WERE NOT NEEDED. -B. WINTER.
      *C
      *C   NOV. 5,1985  ADDED CALLS TO FINDJCW, NLAPPEND, CATOPEN, AND
      *C                CATCLOSE IN ORDER TO ACCOMODATE THE NATIVE
      *C                LANGUAGE SUPPORT FACILITY.  ADDED LINKAGES AND
      *C                ALSO MADE THE CHANGE TO THE FORMFILE NAMES.
      *C                CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF TSCRPRNT TO TSCRPRT2,
      *C                TDATECHK TO TDATECK2.
      *C                THIS WAS TO INCORPORATE THE NATIVE LANGUAGE
003900*C                SUPPORT VERSIONS OF THESE SUBROUTINES.
004000*C                                          PAUL D RAGLOW.
004100*C
004200*C   FEBRUARY 1986                      BARBARA WINTER.
004210*C      SPLIT MAIN PROGRAM INTO 2 PROGRAMS; MAIN PROGRAM THAT
004220*C      PERFORMS ALL OPENS AND CLOSES, AND A FRONT END SCREEN
004230*C      SUBROUTINE.  TOOK OUT FLIP FLOP FUNCTION.
004100*C
004100*C   03/17/93    BK DISMUKES   REQUEST #6061
004100*C      1. ADDED LOGIC TO SEARCH HISTORY DATABASE.  'F6' WILL
004100*C         CALL SINVPOBH.
004100*C
      *C   02/21/94    JS BUNGO      REQUEST #6449
      *C      ADDED NEW FIELDS TO HISTORY DATABASES TO MATCH THE
      *C      LIVE DATABASES.  CHANGED/RECOMPILED THIS PROGRAM TO
      *C      USE THE NEW HISTORY FIELDS.
      *C
      *C   02/21/95    CA ZUBEK      REQUEST #95-002
      *C      ADDED OPTION TO VIEW PO'S WITH THE MOST RECENT ONE
      *C      FIRST.
      *C
      *C   05/03/95    WL MCINTYRE   REQUEST #95-007
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TALTVENK TO ALLOW USER TO ENTER AN
      *C     ALTERNATE KEY, AND HAVE THE LINKED VENDOR CODE
      *C     SUBSTITUTED IN THE ALTERNATE KEY'S PLACE.
      *C
      *C   07/22/96    CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C   12/19/96    JEFF BUNGO  96-044
      *C     ALLOW SEARCH TO BE LIMITED BY BUYER CODE AND ALSO
      *C     ALLOW F1 TO START Q6A VENDOR INQUIRY.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
      *C    DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
      *C    NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSPOBYVEN CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
      *C    FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *C---------------------------------------------------------------
      *C MMM DD, CCYY  XXXNAMEXXX    XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
      *C    XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX DESC XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
      *****************************************************************

004300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
004500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    AS-400.
004600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    AS-400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
DCR01             ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSPOBYVEN-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

            SELECT DVENDOR-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DPORECD-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0902
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

            SELECT DPORECDH-I
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLST0302
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

016800 DATA DIVISION.
016900 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC          PIC X(2000).
017000
       FD  DVENDOR-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.
017000
       FD  DPORECD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0900  OF MCFLCS0902.
017000
       FD  DPORECDH-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECDH-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPST0300  OF MCFLST0302.

004900
005000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
005700
       77  RET-CODE-TALTVENK         PIC X(02)    VALUE "00".
       77  BASE-TALTVENK             PIC X(20).
       77  ALT-KEY-ARG               PIC X(10).
       77  ALT-VEND-CODE             PIC X(10).
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1      PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2      PIC X.
       01  RELATIVE-RECNO         PIC 9(9).

      *------ WS CONTROL AREA
       01  MAJOR-MINOR                 PIC XXXX.
       01  WS-CONTROL.
           02  FUNCTION-NUM            PIC XX.
                   88  EXIT-KEY-F8-USED                     VALUE "08". LVW000LS
                   88  REFRESH-KEY-F4-USED                  VALUE "04". LVW000LS
                   88  ENTER-KEY-USED                       VALUE "00". LVW000LS
                   88  F1-KEY-USED                          VALUE "01". LVW000LS
                   88  F2-KEY-USED                          VALUE "02". LVW000LS
                   88  F3-KEY-USED                          VALUE "03". LVW000LS
                   88  F4-KEY-USED                          VALUE "04". LVW000LS
                   88  F5-KEY-USED                          VALUE "05". LVW000LS
                   88  F6-KEY-USED                          VALUE "06". LVW000LS
                   88  F7-KEY-USED                          VALUE "07". LVW000LS
                   88  F8-KEY-USED                          VALUE "08". LVW000LS
           02 FUN-KEY REDEFINES FUNCTION-NUM PIC XX.
           02 TERMINAL-ID PIC X(10).
           02 FORMAT-NAME PIC X(10).

       01  DISPLAY-STATUS              PIC X(2).

       01  SRF-INDICATORS.
           05  IND OCCURS 99 TIMES   PIC 1 INDICATOR 01.

       COPY IOFEEDBACK OF COPYLIB.

       01  RELATIVE-KEY             PIC 9(9).
       01  LASTREC-READ             PIC 9(4).
006600 01  FORM-NAMES.
006700     05  VENDOR-REQUEST            PIC X(8)     VALUE "VPOBYVEN".
006800
006900 01  SAVE-VIEW-STATUS          PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO  COMP-4.
007500 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
007600     05  MSG-TEXT              PIC X(68)    VALUE SPACE.
007700     05  MSG-FLD               PIC X(8)     VALUE SPACE.
007800     05  MSG-FLD-9  REDEFINES  MSG-FLD      PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
008000 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76    COMP-4.
008200 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO  COMP-4.
008400 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1     COMP-4.
