010900         10  DE1-VENDOR-7      PIC X(7).
011000         10  DE1-VENDOR-3      PIC X(3).
           05  DE1-BUYER             PIC X(4).
           05  DE1-COMMAND-LINE      PIC X(79).
           05  DE1-MESSAGE-LINE      PIC X(79).
011300*************************************************************
